<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Edesur 9-month net to Sept 30 $61 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Edesur 9-month net to Sept 30 $61 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30. Net $61 million vs n/a.</p>
<p>NOTE: Company did not provide comparative figures nor EPS. Q3 unavailable. Edesur is owned by a consortium led by Chile's Enersis.</p>
